Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS: Qt 6 programs draw their Qt Quick scenes with Direct3D 11,
; their default on Windows. sg-shell 235-243 set QSG_RHI_BACKEND=opengl here,
; machine-wide, because Qt WebEngine hands each web frame to Qt Quick as a
; shared Direct3D 11 texture and our Direct3D 11 (DXVK on Wine's Vulkan) could
; not share textures: GOG GALAXY's window stayed blank white. wine-sg 10.0-807
; shares them (VK_KHR_external_memory_win32), so the override goes: this file
; takes the value away again on machines that have it. A program's own
; Compatibility settings (Environment) can still set it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\System\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Environment]
"QSG_RHI_BACKEND"=-
